## tl/english/story_night2.rpy
## English Translation - Night 2: The Locked Portrait (Portrait Gallery and the Bleeding Canvas)

translate english strings:

    old "Matahari sore akhirnya tenggelam seutuhnya di balik punggung bukit granit Ashwood."
