    old "Aku kembali ke dalam kamar tamu di lantai dua."
    new "I returned to the guest chamber on the second floor."

    old "Setelah memastikan pintu terkunci rapat dengan kunci kuningan berukir mawar, aku duduk di dekat perapian yang menyala hangat."
    new "Having made sure the door was bolted fast with the rose-carved brass key, I sat beside the hearth where the flames burned warm."

    old "Di luar jendela, badai salju tipis bercampur hujan mulai turun menyelimuti taman mawar."
    new "Beyond the glass, a sleety gale began to veil the rose garden outside."

    old "Tepat ketika jarum jam menara berdentang dua belas kali menandakan tengah malam..."
    new "Just as the clock tower tolled twelve times for midnight..."

    old "{i}Kreeek... Tap... Tap... Tap...{/i}"
    new "{i}Creeeak... Tap... Tap... Tap...{/i}"

    old "Dari langit-langit di atas kepalaku, terdengar suara langkah kaki halus yang melangkah mondar-mandir di lantai tiga!"
    new "From the ceiling overhead came the faint rustle of footsteps pacing restlessly on the third floor!"

    old "Suara langkah itu terdengar lambat dan teratur, seolah seseorang sedang berjalan dalam tidur di ruangan yang seharusnya dirantai dan dikunci rapat."
    new "The tread was slow and rhythmic, as though someone walked in slumber within chambers supposed to be chained and bolted shut."

    old "Lantai tiga... Padahal tangga menuju ke sana dirantai besi dan digembok..."
    new "The third floor... even though the stairway is barred with heavy chains and padlocks..."

    old "Siapa yang berjalan di atas sana setelah tengah malam?"
    new "Who walks up there after the stroke of midnight?"

    old "Aturan pertama kembali berdengung di telingaku:"
    new "The first rule rang once more in my ears:"

    old "{i}Jangan pernah membuka pintu kamar mana pun di lantai tiga setelah tengah malam tiba.{/i}"
    new "{i}Never open any chamber door on the third floor after midnight arrives.{/i}"

    old "Tetap berada di dalam kamar, mengamati langit-langit hingga suara langkah kaki mereda"
