    old "Aku kembali ke ranjangku, menarik selimut beludru tebal, dan menatap ke arah langit-langit berukir dalam keheningan temaram perapian."
    new "I returned to my bed, pulled up the heavy velvet quilt, and stared up at the carved ceiling in the hearth's dim glow."

    old "Malam kedua di Rose Manor berakhir dengan kecurigaan yang semakin menebal."
    new "The second night at Rose Manor concluded amidst deepening suspicion."

    old "Potret Lilith yang berdarah, catatan tahun 1884 milik Evelyn, dan misteri langkah kaki di lantai tiga..."
    new "Lilith's bleeding portrait, Evelyn's 1884 record, and the phantom steps on the third floor..."

    old "Kepingan-kepingan teka-teki itu mulai membentuk lingkaran bahaya yang mengancam jiwaku."
    new "The scattered pieces of the riddle began to forge a circle of peril that threatened my very soul."
